{%- comment -%}
  Brutalforce: THE free shipping promo switch. Outputs "true" or "false" (no whitespace).
  Theme settings > Free shipping > "Free shipping promo active" + optional "Promo end date".
  Everything that claims free shipping reads this: the cart bar, the cart summary (FREE line and
  the shipping part of Total savings), the footer note, the cart suggestions heading, the product
  page box and the 3-Pack value block. Switch it off (or let the end date pass) and all of it
  disappears at once. The Shopify discount "FreeShipping" must be ended in Shopify as well.
  Usage: {%- capture fs_on -%}{%- render 'bf-free-shipping-active' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign active = false
  if settings.free_shipping_promo_enabled and settings.free_shipping_threshold != blank
    assign active = true
    if settings.free_shipping_promo_end != blank
      assign today = 'now' | date: '%Y-%m-%d'
      assign end_date = settings.free_shipping_promo_end | date: '%Y-%m-%d'
      if end_date != blank and today > end_date
        assign active = false
      endif
    endif
  endif
  echo active
-%}
